# SRS 빌드 중간 산출물 (최종 .md / .md.json 만 커밋)
docs/srs/*/

# Evidence is never ignored.
#
# A bare *.log above swallowed docs/analysis/**/*.log, so writing evidence as .log made it
# INVISIBLE TO git status -- the tree read clean and a reviewer saw a complete commit. That
# is worse than losing evidence outside the repository, because nothing ever asks. 382 logs
# survived only because each bundle carried its own negation and every lane remembered.
#
# Negating *.log alone would fix one extension and leave the class open: *.tmp, *.temp,
# tmp/, temp/, coverage/ and logs/ are all bare patterns that would swallow an evidence
# file the same way. So this unignores the evidence tree itself rather than a file type.
!docs/analysis/**
